sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Web
    participant Intelligence
    participant Relationship
    participant Operations
    participant Azure
    participant Audit

    User->>Web: Define change
    Web->>Intelligence: Create assessment
    Intelligence->>Relationship: Request bounded impact graph
    Relationship-->>Intelligence: Versioned graph snapshot
    Intelligence-->>Web: Risk, findings, input hash
    User->>Operations: Create operation from assessment
    Operations-->>Web: Approval required
    User->>Operations: Approve immutable input hash
    User->>Operations: Execute
    Operations->>Azure: Typed allow-listed operation
    Azure-->>Operations: Provider result/request IDs
    Operations-->>Audit: Domain events via Service Bus
    Operations-->>Web: Verified final state

